BC-2 runner patch for the executeCollected check leg (timing only, never merge).
Applies with `git apply` to tools/re2-benchmark/language/collection.py on the bc2-base and bc2-bench
trees (82161752f, db88f7cdf; identical tools to origin/main 11b9291e1). bulk.py needs no change: the
manifest keeps operations ["compile", "execute"].
Use: run only the Q2 native twophase-ab legs with REGULATOR_BULK_EXECUTE_METHOD=executeCollected in the
environment; every other leg runs without it. The JMH selector becomes
  ^io.airlift.regulator.BenchmarkLanguageBulk\.executeCollected$
and the result check accepts that benchmark name. A runner that calls JMH directly uses that selector
with the same -p engine=trino -p workloadFile=... -p expectedResult=... -p maxMemoryMiB=16 arguments.

